# Build products and downloaded sources — all REPRODUCIBLE from fetch.py + the staged scripts,
# and all far too large for a source repo: `data/` is 2.1 GB of federal rasters/vectors (3DEP,
# NLCD, canopy, CDL, NWI, TIGER, DOF), `work/` 5.2 GB of warped intermediates, and `out/` holds
# the built pack — 89 MB for ONE 1°x1° cell. The packs' home is HuggingFace as classic LFS.
# (`ios/ATCTranscribeTests/lz_fixture.lzpack` IS tracked: a 16 KB 4-tile fixture the unit tests
# need, because a test that needs a 2 GB download is not a test.)
#
# `static/` is deliberately NOT ignored: the frozen public-domain HIFLD snapshot is checked in,
# because its upstream no longer exists.
data/
work/
out/
__pycache__/

# Publish checkpoint — machine-local record of what this box has already uploaded.
.published.json
